# Regenerable bulk (about 1.6 GB): meshes, flow fields, sampled grids and per-case viewer intermediates.
# Rebuild with `py tools/vtol.py geometry`, `mesh --level N`, `cfd run <case>`, `cfd post <case>`.
# Kept: run configs, solver logs, residual histories, mesh stats, results and checks JSON, the packed viewer data.
*.su2
*.npz
*.brep
restart_flow.csv
solution_flow.csv
surface_flow.csv
*.vtu
*.vtk
post/*_viz.json
